== Common Achievement Guides ==
Consult the specific character's page for tips on unlocking a specific [[Characters|character]], as well as tips on playing that character. Each [[completion mark|completion mark's]] page has additional tips for the specific encounter.

For completing or unlocking a [[challenge]], refer to the challenge's specific page.

Tips for filling the [[Donation Machine]] and [[Greed Donation Machine]] are on those pages.

Most other achievements involve doing a basic task repeatedly or having a lucky combination of items, and will be gained with natural play.

