== {{dlc+|a+}} Lachryphagy ==
[[Lachryphagy]] is unlocked by obtaining 10 Tears Up Items/Pills in one run. In normal gameplay this can be extremely rare, and is most often earned accidentally by obtaining this many items by chance. The following are some strategies for obtaining the achievement:
* Each item collected counts towards the Achievement. Dropping a tears up an item will not count against the total. Progress towards the achievement is only tied to items and pills, and is not directly tied to the actual tears stat. As such, reaching the tear cap or collecting Tears Down pills or items will not count against the achievement.
* {{C|Lazarus}} starts with a pill, so restarting repeatedly until they have a Tears Up pill ensures that the pill type will be available during the run. From there, prioritizing {{I|Mom's Bottle of Pills}}, {{I|Placebo}} and {{I|PHD}} will allow them to generate more of these pills. This can be much easier to do in [[Greed mode]], as Isaac can often reroll the shop items until he finds these, as well as repeatedly buy pills until another Tears Up one appears.
* {{C|Tainted Cain}} can craft items that count towards the achievement.
* Obtaining a large number of items, then repeatedly rerolling them such as by using {{I|D4}} can allow Isaac to get more Tears Up items. Losing a Tears Up item this way will not count against the achievement.
* {{dlc|r}} A [[Golden Pill]] can be used if Tears Up is not a part of the current run's Pill pool, where when used repeatedly can grant many Tears Up bonuses, but this is very luck-based.
* Many Tears Up items come from the Item Room and Boss Room pools. {{I|The Pact}} and {{I|Dark Prince's Crown}} can be found in the Devil Deal and Curse Room Pools, whilst {{I|Act of Contrition}} can only be found in the Angel Pool, and {{I|Odd Mushroom (Thin)}} is the only item in the Secret Room Pool that counts towards the achievement. This means collecting as many boss room drops as possible is preferred, but in general going after all item pools is a good idea. The odds of getting tears up items from boss drops can be increased by using {{p|IV - The Emperor?}} successfully, and {{I|Pandora's Box}} on specific floors.

Only items internally tagged [[Item Tags tearsup|tearsup]], as well as any Tears Up pills, will count towards unlocking Lachryphagy. This includes the following items.
{{collectible table | tag = tearsup }}
Note that no active items count towards unlocking Lachryphagy.

